          "worked": "The class centres, in thousands of dollars, are $375,385,395,405$.\n\nFind ordinary frequencies from successive cumulative frequencies:\n$$\\begin{aligned}f_1&=30\\\\f_2&=80-30=50\\\\f_3&=150-80=70\\\\f_4&=200-150=50\\end{aligned}$$\n\nMultiply each class centre by its frequency:\n$$\\begin{aligned}375\\times30&=11250\\\\385\\times50&=19250\\\\395\\times70&=27650\\\\405\\times50&=20250\\end{aligned}$$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{\\sum cc\\times f}{\\sum f}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{11250+19250+27650+20250}{200}\\\\\\bar{x}&=392\\text{ thousand dollars}\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThe estimated mean house price is $\\$392\\,000$.",
